  "description": "Exports a DocWright Word document as an SSRS report template (.rdl for a report server, .rdlc for a ReportViewer host): page setup, Tablix tables, embedded images, and merge fields bound as =Fields!Name.Value dataset expressions, in RDL 2016/01 (default) or 2010/01. Export only, and not the reporting engine: to read, run or render existing reports, use DocWright.Reporting and DocWright.Reporting.Rdl. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
